    rdfs:comment "A framework for interconnected metaverse instances operating as a decentralised, AI-driven ecosystem, in which specialised software agents mediate interoperability, value exchange, identity, and adaptable governance across otherwise-sovereign virtual worlds. Each instance exposes a machine- and human-readable ontology (Linked-JSON) that agents at the edges translate and arbitrate between."@en ;
