ngm:ai-agent-identity a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:comment "A persistent, verifiable digital identity assigned to an autonomous AI agent, enabling it to authenticate, sign transactions, and participate in decentralised systems on behalf of itself or a principal. AI agent identity encompasses credential issuance, key management, and delegation of authority scoped to the agent's operational context. Such identities may be anchored on a blockchain ledger to ensure auditability and prevent impersonation. They bridge self-sovereign identity (SSI) principles with agentic software systems."@en ;
    rdfs:label "Ai Agent Identity"@en ;
    rdfs:subClassOf ngm:blockchain ;
    rdfs:subClassOf ngm:verifiable-credentials ;
    rdfs:subClassOf _:r1505 ;
    rdfs:subClassOf _:r1506 ;
