ngm:animation-software a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:comment "Animation Software encompasses digital tools and applications for creating computer-generated moving images through 3D modeling, rigging, motion graphics, rendering, and compositing, supporting the complete animation pipeline from asset creation to final output for games, film, and metaverse content."@en ;
