ngm:apache-spark a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:comment "Apache Spark is an open-source unified analytics engine for large-scale data processing across clusters of machines. It exposes high-level APIs for batch processing, structured queries, stream processing and machine learning, and accelerates workloads by keeping intermediate data in memory between operations. Spark abstracts distributed datasets as fault-tolerant collections and schedules computations as directed acyclic graphs of stages, making it a foundational tool for big-data engineering and analytics."@en ;
    rdfs:label "Apache Spark"@en ;
