ngm:applied-ai-research-portfolio a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:comment "Recent Projects is a curated portfolio page cataloguing active and completed applied research and commercial engagements spanning conversational AI, autonomous marine vision systems, human-attention analytics, large-scale exhibition AI, GenAI film pre-visualisation, interactive image/video generation, text-to-3D modelling, Bitcoin-native digital assets, AI education products, and Logseq-based training materials. It serves as an index of practical deployments demonstrating cross-domain expertise in AI, robotics, spatial computing, and blockchain."@en ;
    rdfs:label "Applied AI Research Portfolio"@en ;
