    rdfs:comment "Attention Aware Interaction refers to human-computer interaction techniques that leverage eye tracking, gaze detection, and attention modeling to understand user focus and adapt interfaces accordingly, enabling foveated rendering, gaze-based selection, and contextual content presentation in VR, A..."@en ;
