ngm:autonomous-operation a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:comment "The sustained execution of a system's core functions without ongoing human intervention, encompassing self-monitoring, self-configuration, self-healing, and self-optimisation capabilities that allow the system to maintain operational objectives across varying environmental conditions and failure states. Autonomous operation represents the highest level of system self-sufficiency on the automation continuum."@en ;
