    rdfs:comment "Autonomous Task Execution refers to the capacity of AI agents or automated systems to independently carry out goal-directed actions — including planning, tool invocation, error recovery, and result validation — without continuous human supervision. It encompasses the full lifecycle from task decomposition through completion, spanning single-step tool calls and long-horizon multi-step workflows."@en ;
