    rdfs:comment "The practice of designing, operating, and evolving blockchain networks to minimize environmental impact through energy-efficient consensus mechanisms, renewable energy integration, and carbon offset strategies, encompassing metrics, governance, and cross-sector environmental accountability."@en ;
