    rdfs:comment "The strategic process of developing a comprehensive roadmap to achieve net-zero greenhouse gas emissions, encompassing emission measurement, science-based reduction targets, interim milestones, decarbonization actions, and residual emission neutralization through permanent carbon removal."@en ;
    rdfs:label "Carbon Neutrality Planning"@en ;
