ngm:counterfactual-explanation a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:comment "An explainable-AI method that accounts for a model's decision by presenting the smallest realistic change to the input that would have produced a different outcome — for example, 'the loan would have been approved had annual income been £5,000 higher' — giving affected individuals actionable recourse without requiring disclosure of the model's internal structure."@en ;
    rdfs:label "Counterfactual Explanation"@en ;
