    rdfs:comment "An integrated framework of mathematical algorithms, protocols, and mechanisms designed to provide information security properties including confidentiality, integrity, authentication, and non-repudiation in adversarial environments. Blockchain cryptographic systems enable trustless operation through mathematical guarantees rather than trusted intermediaries."@en ;
    rdfs:label "Cryptographic System"@en ;
