    rdfs:comment "Death of the Internet is a concept cluster in the ics-society and Media Theory domains capturing the convergent degradation of the public World Wide Web as a space for authentic human knowledge-exchange, discovery, and democratic discourse."@en ;
    rdfs:label "Death of the Internet"@en ;
