ngm:democratic-governance a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:comment "The exercise of collective decision-making through participatory, accountable, and transparent processes in which stakeholders deliberate and vote on rules and resource allocation; in digital and blockchain contexts it encompasses DAO voting, token-weighted and one-person-one-vote mechanisms, and community oversight of platforms and protocols."@en ;
    rdfs:label "Democratic Governance"@en ;
