    rdfs:comment "Virtual items and assets that can be owned, transferred, traded, or used within metaverse environments, typically with provable scarcity and verifiable ownership recorded on distributed ledgers; they span avatar wearables, virtual land, in-game items, and creative works monetised through creator economies and virtual commerce."@en ;
