ngm:document-processing a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:comment "The automated ingestion, interpretation, and transformation of documents — scans, PDFs, forms, invoices, contracts, and email — into structured, machine-actionable data, combining optical character recognition, layout analysis, classification, and entity extraction; in its AI-driven form (intelligent document processing) it feeds downstream automation, search, and analytics with high-accuracy extracted content."@en ;
