    rdfs:comment "Ecma International is an industry standards organisation that develops and maintains specifications for information and communication technology, most notably the ECMAScript language standard (ECMA-262). It operates through technical committees that produce royalty-free, openly published standards adopted across the software industry. Ecma collaborates with bodies such as ISO and IEC to give its specifications wider international standing."@en ;
