ngm:embodiment a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:comment "The sense of inhabiting a body — in immersive systems, the subjective experience that a virtual body or avatar is one's own, arising from synchronised visuomotor and multisensory feedback and decomposable into self-location, agency, and body ownership; a foundational construct for presence, social VR, telepresence, and embodied theories of cognition."@en ;
