ngm:erc3643-token a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:comment "The ERC-3643 (T-REX) standard is an Ethereum permissioned token framework designed for compliant security token issuance, embedding on-chain identity verification and transfer-restriction logic that enforces investor eligibility, jurisdiction rules, and AML/KYC requirements at the smart contract level. Transfer authorisation is governed by an on-chain identity registry and a modular compliance module, enabling automated regulatory enforcement."@en ;
