ngm:experiment-tracking a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:comment "The systematic recording of every machine-learning training run — hyperparameters, code version, dataset version, environment, metrics, and resulting artefacts — in a queryable store, so that results can be compared across runs, reproduced exactly, and promoted to production with a complete audit trail linking a deployed model back to the precise conditions that produced it."@en ;
