ngm:factor-graph a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:comment "A factor graph is a bipartite graphical model that factorises a global function into a product of local factors, connecting variable nodes to the factor nodes that constrain them. It makes the structure of an inference problem explicit and supports efficient message-passing algorithms. In robotics it is the dominant representation for state estimation problems such as SLAM and sensor fusion."@en ;
    rdfs:label "Factor Graph"@en ;
    rdfs:subClassOf ngm:graphical-model ;
