ngm:gauge-voting a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:comment "Gauge voting is a mechanism in DeFi protocols such as Curve where token holders allocate weights to liquidity pool gauges, determining how reward emissions are distributed across pools each epoch. Voting power is typically proportional to vote-escrowed (veToken) balances, creating direct economic incentives for bribe markets and liquidity direction."@en ;
    rdfs:label "Gauge Voting"@en ;
