ngm:generative-ai-near-term-forecasts a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:comment "A curated set of near-term forecasts for the generative AI video and creative-tool landscape, covering model aggregators, story-level tooling, template ecosystems, real-time trend integration, open-source convergence, inference cost reduction, specialised models, and the social/legal challenges of AI-generated content. These predictions frame strategic planning for platforms operating in the AI creative economy."@en ;
