    rdfs:comment "The Hiroshima AI Process is a G7-led international initiative, launched in 2023, to develop shared principles and a voluntary code of conduct for organisations developing advanced AI systems. It promotes safe, secure, and trustworthy AI through international cooperation on guardrails for foundation and generative models. The process represents a multilateral, soft-law approach to AI governance complementing national regulation."@en ;
