ngm:industry-4-0 a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:comment "Industry 4.0 denotes the fourth industrial revolution, characterised by the integration of cyber-physical systems, industrial Internet of Things, cloud computing, advanced robotics, and artificial intelligence into manufacturing and supply chain operations to create smart, autonomous, and highly flexible production environments. Originating from a German government initiative, it represents a strategic framework for digitalising industrial production through real-time data exchange, machine intelligence, and networked automation."@en ;
    rdfs:label "Industry 4.0"@en ;
    rdfs:subClassOf ngm:industrial-automation ;
