ngm:isda-common-domain-model a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:comment "The ISDA Common Domain Model is the full name of the standardised, machine-readable representation of financial products, trade events, and lifecycle processes maintained by the International Swaps and Derivatives Association. It establishes a single canonical model so that distributed ledgers, smart contracts, and institutional systems process derivatives transactions identically and without reconciliation. It is a cornerstone standard for interoperable, automated post-trade infrastructure."@en ;
    rdfs:label "ISDA Common Domain Model"@en ;
