    rdfs:comment "ISO/IEC 30170 is the international standard specifying the syntax and semantics of the Ruby programming language. Published in 2012 and derived from the Japanese standard JIS X 3017, it defines Ruby's object model, execution behaviour and core language constructs so that independent implementations can conform to a common specification."@en ;
