    rdfs:label "Layer 2 Solution"@en .
ngm:layer-2-solutions a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:comment "Layer 2 solutions are protocols and systems built atop a base blockchain (layer 1) that handle transactions off the main chain to increase throughput, reduce latency, and lower transaction costs, while periodically settling finality back to the underlying layer 1 for security. The principal layer 2 paradigms include optimistic rollups, zero-knowledge rollups, state channels, and sidechains, each offering distinct trust and performance tradeoffs."@en ;
    rdfs:label "Layer 2 Solutions"@en ;
