    rdfs:comment "A software application designed to operate within or alongside a metaverse platform, providing users with persistent virtual experiences including social interaction, commerce, entertainment, education, and collaboration. Metaverse applications leverage real-time 3D rendering, avatar systems, spatial audio, and interoperability standards to deliver presence-rich, cross-platform functionality within shared virtual environments."@en ;
