    rdfs:comment "The residual tier in the EU AI Act's four-level risk pyramid, covering AI systems not classified as prohibited, high-risk, or limited-risk. Such systems carry no AI Act-specific compliance obligations and remain subject only to applicable horizontal legislation such as GDPR and product liability rules."@en ;
