ngm:mining a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:comment "Mining is the proof-of-work block-creation process in which participating nodes compete to solve a cryptographic hash puzzle, with the winner appending the next block to the chain and receiving a block reward. Mining provides Sybil resistance, ensures probabilistic finality, and anchors chain security to real-world energy expenditure."@en ;
