ngm:model-retraining a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:comment "The post-deployment lifecycle activity of training a machine learning model again on refreshed or expanded data after production monitoring detects data drift, concept drift, or performance degradation, restoring predictive accuracy without redesigning the model. Retraining closes the MLOps feedback loop between monitoring and deployment, and may be scheduled periodically or triggered automatically by drift-detection thresholds."@en ;
    rdfs:label "Model Retraining"@en ;
