    rdfs:comment "The Moving Picture Experts Group, the ISO/IEC standardisation body (formally ISO/IEC JTC 1/SC 29 working groups) that since 1988 has defined the dominant international standards for compressed digital audio and video — MPEG-1 and MP3, MPEG-2 for broadcast television and DVD, MPEG-4 AVC/H.264, HEVC, and VVC for streaming, plus systems standards such as MP4, MPEG-DASH, and MPEG-H spatial audio — underpinning virtually all modern media distribution."@en ;
    rdfs:label "MPEG"@en ;
