ngm:natural-language-processing a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:comment "Natural Language Processing (NLP) is the subfield of AI focused on enabling computers to understand, interpret, generate, and manipulate human language. Core tasks include text classification, named entity recognition, machine translation, sentiment analysis, question answering, and language generation, underpinned by transformer architectures and large-scale pre-training."@en ;
