    rdfs:comment "The collaborative technology and innovation ecosystem spanning Manchester, Leeds, Liverpool, Sheffield, and Newcastle that constitutes the Northern Powerhouse. The corridor links world-class research universities, NHS trusts, advanced manufacturing facilities, and digital startups through coordinated investment, shared infrastructure, and regional development frameworks aimed at closing the productivity gap between North and South England."@en ;
