ngm:offline-reinforcement-learning a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:comment "Offline reinforcement learning trains a policy from a fixed dataset of previously collected experience without further interaction with the environment. It avoids online exploration, which makes it suitable where data collection is costly or unsafe."@en ;
