    rdfs:comment "The multimodal sensory and cognitive engagement a user undergoes within a telepresence or immersive environment, encompassing visual fidelity, spatial audio, haptic feedback, and sense of presence. Perceptual experience quality determines the degree to which a distributed or virtual interaction is felt as equivalent to physical co-presence, directly impacting collaboration effectiveness and user well-being."@en ;
