    rdfs:comment "A reinforcement learning algorithm that updates policies through incremental steps whilst constraining how much the policy can change via a clipped surrogate objective, preventing destabilising updates. PPO is the dominant RL algorithm used in reinforcement learning from human feedback (RLHF) for fine-tuning language models to align with human preferences."@en ;
