ngm:remote-communication a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:comment "Remote Communication encompasses the protocols, platforms, and practices that enable synchronous and asynchronous exchange of information between geographically distributed participants. It spans text, voice, video, and immersive modalities, and underpins distributed work, telecollaboration, and telepresence systems by abstracting physical distance through networked infrastructure."@en ;
