ngm:robotics-control a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:comment "The application of artificial intelligence and control theory to robotic systems to enable autonomous navigation, manipulation, perception, and task execution. AI-driven robotics control integrates reinforcement learning for policy optimisation, computer vision for scene perception, motion planning for collision-free trajectory generation, and sensor fusion for robust state estimation — operating in real time under uncertainty and safety constraints."@en ;
