ngm:state-space-sequence-models a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:comment "State Space and Other Approaches encompasses structured state space models (SSMs) and related sequence modelling architectures, most notably the Mamba family, which apply selective state-space mechanisms to achieve linear-time sequence processing. These approaches offer a compelling alternative to Transformers by combining efficient recurrence with hardware-aware algorithms, enabling superior throughput on long sequences across language, vision, and genomics domains."@en ;
    rdfs:label "State Space Sequence Models"@en ;
