ngm:terminology-playbook a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:comment "The canonical usage guide for knowledge-stack terminology across the DreamLab mesh: which artefact the words taxonomy, ontology, knowledge graph, reasoning, grounding and context graph each name, the one-line gloss each term carries at first use on a public surface, and the conflations the mesh's own copy must avoid. The source of truth is VisionFlow/docs/terminology.md; this page is its published mirror."@en ;
