    rdfs:comment "A speech-synthesis technology that converts written text into spoken audio output using neural vocoder models, enabling voice interfaces, accessibility tools, voice assistants, and real-time narration. Modern TTS systems leverage transformer-based architectures to produce natural, expressive speech with controllable prosody."@en ;
