    rdfs:comment "The transformer is a neural network architecture introduced by Vaswani et al. in 'Attention Is All You Need' (2017). It replaces recurrence and convolution with multi-head self-attention and position-wise feed-forward layers, enabling fully parallel sequence processing, and underpins large language models and modern vision, speech, and protein-structure systems."@en ;
