ngm:treatment-planning a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:comment "The clinical process of deciding how a patient's condition will be treated: integrating diagnosis, imaging, patient history, and evidence-based guidelines into a specific course of therapy with defined goals, doses, sequencing, and review points; in domains such as radiotherapy and surgery it is a quantitative, imaging-driven activity that medical image analysis and medical imaging AI systems support but do not replace."@en ;
