    rdfs:comment "Techniques that let a party outsource a computation and receive a proof that the result is correct, allowing efficient verification without redoing the work. Proof systems such as SNARKs and STARKs make verification exponentially cheaper than re-execution, enabling trust-minimised delegation at scale."@en ;
