ngm:vr-experiences a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:comment "Designed interactive episodes delivered through fully immersive virtual reality, in which a head-mounted display replaces the user's visual field with a rendered or captured environment they can look around, move through, and act within. VR experiences span entertainment, training, virtual tours, and destination previews; unlike AR experiences, which overlay content on the physical world, they substitute the world entirely, trading environmental awareness for presence and total authorial control of the scene."@en ;
