ngm:web-application a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:comment "A web application is interactive software delivered over the web and executed primarily within a browser, combining client-side code with server-side services accessed over HTTP. It renders user interfaces, manages state, and communicates with back-end APIs to provide functionality comparable to native applications without installation. Web applications rely on open web standards for portability across devices and platforms."@en ;
